OL,3,AGreens would offer two-year jobs to
OL,4,Aunemployed under-24s
OL,5,
OL,6,FYoung people would be offered a
OL,7,Fguaranteed two-year job within four
OL,8,Fmonths of leaving education or
OL,9,Ftraining, under a new proposal unveiled
OL,10,Fby the Green Party.
OL,12,FAnnouncing the policy at the party's
OL,13,Fconference in Brighton, co-deputy
OL,14,Fleader Mothin Ali said there were a
OL,15,Fmillion "bored, desperate and lost"
OL,16,Fyoung people who were out of work,
OL,17,Ftraining or education.
OL,19,FUnder the proposed scheme, youngsters
OL,20,Fwould be offered posts in the private
OL,21,Fsector, with the government paying half
OL,22,Ftheir salary.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
