OL,3,AGreens would offer two-year jobs to
OL,4,Aunemployed under-24s
OL,5,
OL,6,FAli said an initial pilot scheme -
OL,7,Frolled out in areas with the fewest job
OL,8,Fopenings for young people - would
OL,9,Fcreate 9,000 jobs, at an overall cost
OL,10,Fof #110m.
